.TH BLACKFORGE 1 "August 2026" "BlackForge 0.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
blackforge \- safety-minded Arch Linux manager for BlackArch and curated security tools
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B blackforge
.RI [ GLOBAL\ OPTIONS ]
.I COMMAND
.RI [ COMMAND\ OPTIONS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
BlackForge searches and inspects the BlackArch website catalog and a reviewed
set of official Arch packages. Package changes are delegated to pacman.
Mutating commands show a plan and require confirmation unless explicitly told
otherwise.
.PP
BlackForge is unofficial and is not affiliated with BlackArch or Arch Linux.
Security tools must only be used on systems the user owns or is authorized to
test.
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.BR --json
Emit machine-readable JSON where supported.
.TP
.BR --dry-run
Preview without changing packages or files.
.TP
.BR -y , " --yes"
Skip BlackForge confirmation and pass --noconfirm to pacman operations.
.TP
.BR --catalog " PATH"
Use a specific validated BlackArch catalog.
.SH CORE COMMANDS
.TP
.BR search " QUERY"
Search tool names, descriptions, and categories.
.TP
.BR show " PACKAGE"
Show source, repository, installation, and maintenance details.
.TP
.BR plan " install|remove|upgrade"
Preview the exact pacman transaction and available metadata.
.TP
.BR install " [--snapshot] PACKAGE..."
Install validated BlackArch or source-qualified official Arch packages.
.TP
.BR remove " PACKAGE..."
Conservatively remove installed packages.
.TP
.BR audit
Report outdated, vulnerable, unavailable, and keyring states. Official Arch
advisories are included when arch-audit is installed.
.TP
.BR lock " create|compare|sbom"
Create exact version locks, compare machine drift, or export CycloneDX/SPDX.
.TP
.BR snapshot " status|create|rollback-plan"
Detect Btrfs/Snapper, create an explicit snapshot, or locate exact cached
package versions for a reviewed rollback command.
.TP
.BR community " list|show|validate|apply"
Work with release-reviewed, data-only community collections.
.TP
.BR aur " --enable-aur search|info"
Query official AUR RPC metadata. No PKGBUILD is downloaded or executed.
.TP
.BR dashboard " build REPORT.html"
Create a portable maintenance and availability report.
.TP
.BR integration " systemd|packagekit"
Generate an optional user timer or PackageKit-style status JSON.
.SH HELP
Run
.B blackforge help COMMAND
for complete command-specific options and examples. Run
.B blackforge help --all
for every parser, or
.B blackforge help --lang tr
for the Turkish quick guide.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/blackforge
Default user installation.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/blackforge
Transaction, update, and dashboard history.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/blackforge
Refreshed catalog cache.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pacman (8),
.BR makepkg (8),
.BR snapper (8),
.BR arch-audit (1)
.PP
Project wiki: https://johnnypatty.github.io/blackforge/wiki/
